NeuChain client-path protobuf messages.

repo:   https://github.com/iDC-NEU/NeuChain.git
ref:    ev
commit: 5180d5e85ff152eac9c8773378cce84a205080b2

neuchain.proto is a hand-transcribed SUBSET of:
  include/proto/transaction.proto   TransactionPayload
  include/proto/tpc-c.proto         YCSB_PAYLOAD
  include/proto/comm.proto          UserRequest, UserQueryRequest, QueryResult, KVRead
  include/proto/block.proto         Block, BlockHeader, BlockData, BlockMetadata

Field numbers/types match upstream exactly. Upstream protos carry no
'option go_package'; that is the only addition here. The block "result frame"
is not protobuf - see resultframe.go.

regenerate:
  cd pkg/adapters/neuchain/proto
  protoc -I . --go_out=. --go_opt=paths=source_relative neuchain.proto

To re-verify against a fresh checkout:
  scripts/neuchain-proto-spike.sh   # pulls the real upstream .proto files
